      "claim": "POL-NS-22 charges the 5.00 SGD fee only where the driver cancels after the free wait, and for an on-demand trip POL-NS-21 starts that wait at the driver's arrival. The record's 390 s is measured from an arrival event that the GPS trace does not corroborate, so the fee's precondition is not made out on this evidence: a 5.00 SGD charge cannot stand on a timer whose start has no support beyond the app's own button press.",
